  "notes": "The raised mountain is not drawn (mountains mood only, no mountain motif over them). A book for «يمسكون بالكتاب» and «خذوا ما آتيناكم بقوة». STAGING v4: c1 (170) is a prayer hall by day: three believers hold the Book and read on 170:2 (they hold fast to it, knowledge and practice), a book plate on 170:3 that leaves at 170:4, a second before the prayer (no plate is on screen while anyone prays), they stand in prayer on 170:5 (they establish the prayer) and bow on 170:8; a soft sparkle on them on 170:10 (the reformers whose reward is not lost). c2 (171) stays ambient (geometric, Allah's act and His command): the mountain raised over them is a miracle and is not drawn at all (no mountain setting, mood or plate, nothing above any people, no people on screen); a seal plate for the covenant on 171:11-14 (take what We gave you with determination; Al-Muyassar: the covenants in the Book) and a book plate for 171:15 to the end (remember what is in it)."
